---
source: crates/biome_css_analyze/tests/spec_tests.rs
expression: invalidRtl.css
---
# Input
```css
/* should generate diagnostics with rtl replacements */
.position {
	right: 1rem;
	left: 3rem;
}

.margin {
	margin-right: 2rem;
	margin-left: 4rem;
}

.padding {
	padding-right: 10px;
	padding-left: 20px;
}

.logical-shorthands {
	margin: 1px 2px 3px 4px;
	padding: 5px 6px 7px 8px;
}

.border {
	border-left: 5px dotted green;
	border-left-color: green;
	border-left-style: dotted;
	border-left-width: 6px;
	border-right: 7px double yellow;
	border-right-color: yellow;
	border-right-style: double;
	border-right-width: 8px;
}

.border-radius {
	border-top-left-radius: 4px;
	border-top-right-radius: 8px;
	border-bottom-left-radius: 12px;
	border-bottom-right-radius: 16px;
}

.values {
	float: right;
	float: left;
	clear: right;
	clear: left;
	text-align: right;
	text-align: left;
	justify-content: right;
	justify-content: left;
	justify-items: right;
	justify-items: left;
	justify-items: legacy left;
	justify-items: right legacy;
	justify-self: right;
	justify-self: left;
}

.anchor-functions {
	right: anchor(left);
	left: anchor(right);
}

```

